  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/10/IMG_5828.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(28 fotos) Aquest dijous ha obert les portes al p&uacute;blic Cerveseria Ca Panera, al carrer de Vila-real, cantonada&nbsp;Ceramista Mundina d&#39;Onda, despr&eacute;s de la inguruaci&oacute; &#39;oficial&#39; de dilluns la nit, a la qual corresponen les imatges. Hamburgeses, tapes, entrepans i grill s&oacute;n les seues especialitats.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciocapanera/img_5821.jpg\" alt=\"img_5821\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciocapanera/img_5823.jpg\" alt=\"img_5823\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciocapanera/img_5826.jpg\" alt=\"img_5826\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciocapanera/img_5828.jpg\" alt=\"img_5828\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciocapanera/img_5829.jpg\" alt=\"img_5829\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciocapanera/img_5830.jpg\" alt=\"img_5830\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciocapanera/img_5832.jpg\" alt=\"img_5832\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciocapanera/img_5833.jpg\" alt=\"img_5833\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguraciocapanera/img_5834.jpg\" alt=\"img_5834\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"h